title Smart loop end: free first loops tapped late, offered and snapped on Suggest, closed on the end you played on Auto
covers smart-end
# Tempo from the first loop on: each free first loop's length sets the
# song's tempo. Two bars of kick (pad 1) and snare (pad 3) at about 120 BPM,
# then the next bar's first kick and REC a little after it, late on purpose.
# On the MPC this shows smart loop end on its own timing: the pads' frames,
# Auto's wait to the end of the reach, and snaps landing on the downbeat.
wait 1
tap header tab Looper
# MENU: Tempo from the first loop On (row 7), Smart loop end Suggest (row 8:
# down to Off, then one up).
button MENU
wheel 6
button +
wheel 1
button -
button -
button +
button MENU
wait 0.5
tap leditor bars Until tap
wait 0.5
mark suggest
button REC
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad-down 1 120
wait 0.06
button REC
pad-up 1
wait 1
expect smart loop end offers the end you played
expect looper: Loop 1 is 2 bars at
expect time: Loop 1 on Audio 1 (a new audio track), row 1, playing
# Snap lands on the loop's next downbeat, with the tempo; Use my tap goes
# back; UNDO then has nothing left, and SHIFT + UNDO snaps again.
tap leditor chip-act Snap
wait 4.5
expect looper: Loop 1: snapped the start
tap leditor chip-act Use my tap
wait 4.5
expect looper: Loop 1: Undo: the start
button UNDO
wait 1
button SHIFT + UNDO
wait 4.5
expect looper: Loop 1: Redo: the start
expect-not refused
mark auto
button STOP
button STOP
tap leditor clear Clear
wait 0.5
# MENU: Smart loop end Auto (row 8, one up from Suggest).
button MENU
wheel 7
button +
button +
button MENU
wait 0.5
# REC a moment before the first kick: Auto starts the loop on it.
button REC
wait 0.05
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad 1 120
wait 0.39
pad 3 100
wait 0.39
pad-down 1 120
wait 0.04
button REC
pad-up 1
wait 1
expect smart loop end closed it on the end you played, and started it on your first hit
expect the song starts at that tempo
tap leditor chip-act Use my tap
wait 4.5
expect looper: Loop 1: back to your tap
expect-not refused
button STOP
button STOP
